<title>USA: Sunshine holders approve increase in shares.</title>
<headline>Sunshine holders approve increase in shares.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sunshine Mining and Refining Co said shareholders approved a proposal to increase the company's authorized shares to 600 million from 400 million and to give directors the authority to execute a reverse split of the company's stock.</p>
<p>No action was taken by the directors to execute a reverse split and none is anticipated in the near term.</p>
</text>
